    "text": "A compound A dissociate by two parallel first order paths at certain temperature<br />\r<br />\r&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>A</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mo>→</mo> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>&nbsp; k</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mn>(</mn> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>min</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mn>)</mn> <mo>&nbsp; </mo> </mrow> </mover> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>B</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <msub> <mtext>k</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>9</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> <msup> <mtext>&nbsp;min</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br />\r<br />\r<math> <mrow> <mtext>A</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mo>→</mo> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>&nbsp; k</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mn>(</mn> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>min</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mn>)</mn> <mo>&nbsp; </mo> </mrow> </mover> <mtext>C</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <msub> <mtext>k</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>9</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> <msup> <mtext>&nbsp;min</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br />\r<br />\rIf reaction started with pure 'A' with 1 mole of A in 1 litre closed container with initial pressure 2 atm. What is the pressure (in atm) developed in container after 50 minutes from start of experiment ?"
